# Ticket 132 -- key names only, transcribed from the live container's
# `docker inspect openclaw-fruit-feishu-gateway --format '{{range .Config.Env}}{{println .}}{{end}}'`
# on 2026-09-07. No values here or ever in this repo -- this file exists so
# the key set is checked in and reviewable even though the values cannot be.
#
# NODE_VERSION / npm_config_registry / PATH / YARN_VERSION are image-layer
# defaults (from the channel-gateway Dockerfile's base image), not secrets;
# everything else is real configuration or a credential. To actually recreate
# this container, fill in a real `fruit-feishu-gateway.env` (no `.example`)
# next to this file on the host -- see docker-compose.yml's env_file: and
# docs/runbooks/fruit-feishu-gateway-recovery.md. Never commit that file.
